---
# Example Homepage services configuration
# Note: In active homelab deployments, config/services.yaml is auto-generated by `appctl sync`.
- Knowledge & Notes:
    - Docs-Viewer:
        icon: files.png
        href: https://docs.roadtotech.me
        description: Reactive Obsidian & Markdown Documentation Viewer
        server: my-docker
        container: docs
    - Excalidraw:
        icon: excalidraw.png
        href: https://excalidraw.roadtotech.me
        description: Collaborative Whiteboarding & Sketching Tool
        server: my-docker
        container: excalidraw

- Media & Productivity:
    - Jellyfin:
        icon: jellyfin.png
        href: https://jellyfin.roadtotech.me
        description: Media Server & Streaming Hub
        server: my-docker
        container: jellyfin
